        "text": "The speaker believes that judicial appointments significantly influence legal precedents.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that 'super precedence' refers to a heightened level of constitutional precedent importance.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts that the discussion participants have sufficient understanding of legal terminology like 'Roe v Wade'.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the Supreme Court as having decisive power over reproductive rights legislation.",
