  {
    "episode_id": 96863,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96863.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 106,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, it was such an amazing, you know, miracle Monday. All of you all came back together to support him. But one thing I will say, you know, women that run for president are definitely held the double standards. And I do see progress in that when I would go to your events, what people would say about you. Just something about her, right? There was just something about you that they like what they would say was she's so real. She's so authentic. Those are not words often said about politicians, particularly women, given all of the double standards that they battle.",
