      },
      {
        "text": "People generally want politicians who get things done.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Bipartisan efforts by politicians can help reduce political division.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "text": "Political effectiveness is measured by tangible outcomes rather than rhetoric.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members value practical results over ideological purity.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Bipartisanship is seen as credible and constructive by the public.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the politician’s actions were genuinely bipartisan.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 96863,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96863.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 114,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, because this is something I think about almost all the time. Some part of my brain is always turning on this. Can you sort of recreate the days where you had bipartisanship? A lot of people think, no, because the incentive structure for the parties is very",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_06",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
      {
        "text": "I think about this topic almost all the time.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "The current party incentive structure discourages bipartisanship.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "A part of my brain is constantly engaged with this issue.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Many people believe that bipartisanship cannot be recreated.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "It is possible to recreate days when bipartisanship existed.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
