        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Slowing down and observing one’s environment is a valid and valuable response to existential challenges.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts their interpretation of the other person's emotional state based on indirect cues.",
        "confidence": 0.84
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 96863,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96863.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 119,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and it gave her a new sense of purpose for a bunch of things that she wanted to tackle in Congress, too, which is cool. And a reminder for everyone to get their medical checks done.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_05",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
